OL,3,GNEWSABradford woman in Nepal tells of
OL,4,Aflooding ordeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from Bradford who narrowly
OL,7,Favoided deadly flash flooding in Nepal
OL,8,Fhas said she is praying for those
OL,9,Faffected.
OL,11,FShashi Sharma, 61, was taking part in
OL,12,Fthe sacred Kailash Mansarovar Yatra
OL,13,Fpilgrimage, a 10-day trek from India to
OL,14,FTibet, which also travels through the
OL,15,Faffected area in Nepal.
OL,17,FMore than 570 people have been killed
OL,18,Fin the disaster which struck on
OL,19,FWednesday, according to Nepalese
OL,20,Fpolice, with almost 1,500 injured.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
