OL,3,GNEWSABradford woman in Nepal tells of
OL,4,Aflooding ordeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FSharma said: "The whole group is very,
OL,7,Fvery sad at the moment, and we are
OL,8,Fpraying for the people - those who have
OL,9,Flost their life, and we're praying for
OL,10,Fthe families, those who are looking for
OL,11,Ftheir loved ones."
